  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.4.0 fixes cold-start connection failures and adds configurable dual-stack networking.\n\n\t\t\t- Added automatic IPv4 fallback when the system connection policy fails against a dual-stack endpoint.\n\t\t\t- Added QBittorrentClientOptions and AddressFamilyPreference for retry, timeout, diagnostics, and address-family configuration.\n\t\t\t- Added zero-dependency real-time network diagnostics through DiagnosticSink.\n\t\t\t- Authenticated before Web API version negotiation to make initialization reliable after cold starts and restarts.\n\t\t\t- Preserved cookies when switching connection handlers and kept caller-provided HttpClient instances caller-owned.\n\t\t\t- Improved retry safety and cleaned up network resources when client initialization fails.",
